# Example environment variables. Placeholders only: never put a real value here
# (this repository is public). Real values live in Vercel and in .env.local.

# Test-account cleanup (OX-1r): the second secret that unlocks the
# secret-gated cleanup database function. Read ONLY by
# lib/server/testCleanupSecret.ts. Unset = the tool is off (503).
# Production only, never Preview: preview builds run branch code from this
# public repo against the same database. The database stores only its sha256
# (runbook docs/runbooks/TEST_ACCOUNT_CLEANUP_RUNBOOK.md, section 6).
TEST_CLEANUP_SECRET=<64-hex-characters-generated-locally>
